3
00:00:10,747 --> 00:00:13,479
Y-G's entire brand is scarcity.

4
00:00:13,479 --> 00:00:14,677
Few debuts.

5
00:00:14,677 --> 00:00:15,747
Long training.

6
00:00:15,747 --> 00:00:17,293
Editorial patience.

7
